available\n+- whether the problem affects the CLI, docs, or workflow automation\n+\n+We will triage reports promptly and coordinate disclosure timing before any\n+public write-up.","raw_url":"https://github.com/wstein/cx-cli/raw/f6ea6d0ca48f5270ec13d79618c301d6b84039c9/SECURITY.md","sha":"a4325ff3122b2100e8a36a5707cc90d43b6a5cbf","status":"added"}]}